WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_15h.avi
Scene: Rinoa at the Sorceress Memorial
Duration: approximately 16 seconds
Describes Rinoa being brought to the crystalline containment facility designed to seal Sorceresses away.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The Sorceress Memorial interior is cold, sterile, and clinical. White fluorescent light illuminates endless rows of crystalline containment units.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Rinoa stands before an open crystal tomb — a translucent hexagonal chamber designed to imprison her indefinitely. Her expression is resigned, almost peaceful, but her eyes betray the weight of this moment.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
She steps inside the crystalline unit. The moment she enters, the structure's interior begins to glow with a soft, cold blue light.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The crystal tomb seals shut with a resonant hum. Rinoa is imprisoned inside — not for a crime, but simply for existing as a Sorceress. The world fears her. The world will contain her. The chamber reflects cold light from every surface.